sequenceDiagram
    participant Workflow as MAF Workflow Node
    participant Agent as MAF Agent
    participant Provider as CognitiveMemoryContextProvider
    participant Recall as RecallOrchestrator
    participant Tools as MemoryTools
    participant Executor as MemoryWorkflowExecutor
    participant Store as MemoryStore

    Workflow->>Executor: Execute agent step
    Executor->>Provider: Build context for goal
    Provider->>Recall: RecallAsync(goal, project, access)
    Recall->>Store: Load records/projections/relations
    Store-->>Recall: Candidates
    Recall-->>Provider: ContextPack
    Provider-->>Agent: Context messages/tool hints
    Agent->>Tools: Optional memory_recall / memory_open_source
    Tools->>Recall: Focused recall request
    Recall-->>Tools: Focused context/result
    Tools-->>Agent: Tool result
    Agent-->>Executor: Agent output
    Executor->>Store: Persist recall trace and reflection source event
